.SS "typedef struct \fBp6est_connectivity\fP \fBp6est_connectivity_t\fP"

.PP
This structure holds the 2D+1D inter-tree connectivity information\&. It is essentially a wrapper of the 2D p4est_connecitivity_t datatype, with some additional information about how the third dimension is embedded\&. 
.SS "typedef void(* p6est_init_t) (\fBp6est_t\fP *\fBp6est\fP, \fBp4est_topidx_t\fP which_tree, \fBp4est_quadrant_t\fP *column, \fBp2est_quadrant_t\fP *layer)"

.PP
